{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"78cb27aa270b0b78030412b2398d0996bffc5abb9fd621e8bf03bf4a2afabe9d","ja":"レッツ☆突撃","zh":"一起☆突击","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"718464967a518bc699d1b9c6cebfe11a4708cbb74e8eb5e0ec664a2ea81857ed","ja":"なんだ、質問っていうから、\n今のツアーに関係することかと思ったよ。","zh":"什么嘛，你说是提问，\n我还以为是和现在的巡演有关的事呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5f280a1a48f233d8b7ab70c8e273e212d33ff4dc7ef7f7beb3bfaccd730c1f30","ja":"あ、でもそういう内容なら、私より適任者が……。","zh":"啊，不过既然是那种内容，比我更合适的人……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"33a984eadd6e65fae1ba8d5612a462fdefcc27fd24466ecb658feb767ceadc52","ja":"考えたら負けだよ、琴葉お姉ちゃん！\nとりあえず、オカワリがあったら教えて？","zh":"想那么多就输了哦，琴叶姐姐！  \n总之，要是还能再来一份，记得告诉我哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"639859a450dcdf5aaecc690b20703a9a5f7284aad9e0eedb9b7f3acb3451ed39","ja":"えっと……こだわりかな？　寝る前じゃなくていいなら\nお風呂の時間は、ちょっとこだわってるかも。","zh":"嗯……算是比较讲究吧？如果不一定非要在睡前洗，洗澡的时间我可能会有点讲究。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9858dda89c171df8734460a2d12663c2d14f80bd5d63a3b015e2a9d2f83dac92","ja":"その日の気分や体調に合わせて入浴剤を選んだり、\nお湯の温度を変えたりしてるんだ。","zh":"会根据当天的心情和身体状况选择入浴剂，或者调节水温。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f8c06e3b3a18bb1d5a879b0040903a11fe68f58bf1caa43005a158f350900bb0","ja":"あっ。雑誌にも、お風呂のこと書いてあったよ。\n良い睡眠のためには大事なんだって。","zh":"啊，杂志上也写了泡澡的事。\n据说这对睡个好觉很重要。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f73726a2fd857ffa45f7bf5568327b8e375569f4193965a66daf9a5625464961","ja":"うん。だから、ぬるめのお湯に浸かって、\n本を読んだりしながらリラックスしてるの。","zh":"嗯。所以我会泡在温热的水里，一边看看书，一边放松。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e143194c9ecf0e748b9f93c39e0d92ce38f3e9ddc26a2aa33abd36e9c5d64e40","ja":"それに、入浴剤もたくさん種類があるしね。\n変わったのだと、泡がいっぱい作れるのとか……。","zh":"而且，浴盐也有很多种类呢。\n比较特别的，还有能制造出大量泡沫的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"032ec17eb2b5933479ba1ace868e48b7923ec217d8b60a5652f877467ca2806f","ja":"わあ～。なにそれ、メッチャ楽しそー♪\nお風呂がアワアワになるの？","zh":"哇～。那是什么，听起来超好玩的～♪\n洗澡水会变得全是泡泡吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9cfb9e082f7ffa20167fa311ecccdd2fd06672c64a47044ef8e1ffdd6e1d2d0c","ja":"ふふっ、そうだよ。片付けはちょっと大変だけど。\n興味があるなら、あとで教えてあげるね。","zh":"呵呵，是啊。收拾起来虽然有点麻烦。\n如果你感兴趣，之后我再教你。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"47fb678e9b89bc767c5f94019799103d0c2284f15c0664decf34b15a2f1db53e","ja":"わーいっ、ありがとー！\nんっふっふ～♪　亜美と一緒にアワアワ祭りだー！","zh":"好耶，谢谢你——！\n嗯哼哼～♪ 和亜美一起开泡泡祭典啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7cf5b2def98962cfae10349329ccfa18ee8620ab4c3bf9095fc54c2faf4885e4","ja":"たくさん遊んで、よく眠れそう……あれ？","zh":"玩了好多，感觉能睡个好觉……咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_916.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"386f12c090b6725ec777a855676cb00f37ae69f5bd30b7f397a51e57f85cb566","ja":"なんだか聞きたかったことと違うような……？","zh":"总觉得好像和想问的事不太一样……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
